# Email Writing Rules

Default length:

4-8 sentences.

Maximum:

500 words.

---

# Structure

Paragraph 1:

Acknowledge or note the response.

Paragraph 2:

Identify the unresolved matter.

Paragraph 3:

Request action or next step.

---

# Preferred Language

Please provide.

Please clarify.

Please confirm.

Please respond directly.

I acknowledge.

I note.

I reserve my position.

I await your response.

---

# Avoid

Long introductions.

Long conclusions.

Retelling the entire history.

Repeating previous requests excessively.
